# W31f, guest b (k10): joins a in stag0201 and lets the notice of a's entry run out; nothing moves b (no leash, no
# pull): it stays in stag0201 while a is in dng204b1, until a's way home ends the instance: b goes home 3 s later.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log b in stag0201
idle until notices>=1 fail epoch>=@800
log b sees the notice
idle until notices=0 fail frames>=1500,stagechange
log b's notice ran out
idle until offers>=1 fail frames>=30
idle until frames>=900 fail stagechange
log nothing moved b
idle until stage=stagml11,control fail epoch>=@1000
log b home
idle until frames>=120
